<section class="ref-group"><h2>Revolts &amp; revolutions <span class="n">1</span></h2><ul class="enc-list"><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/revolts-of-522-520-bce"><span class="enc-name">Revolts of 522–520 BCE</span><span class="enc-type">Revolt · 522–520 BCE</span><span class="enc-snip">The revolts of 522–520 BCE were a wave of rebellions that broke out across the Achaemenid Empire during the disputed succession that brought Darius I to the throne.</span></a></li></ul></section>
